[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3366303557","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110779#issuecomment-3366303557","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110779","id":3366303557,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7IpbdF","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-03T16:07:28Z","updated_at":"2025-10-03T16:07:28Z","body":"Needs rebase.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3366303557/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3367214940","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110779#issuecomment-3367214940","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110779","id":3367214940,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Is59c","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-03T21:05:44Z","updated_at":"2025-10-03T21:05:44Z","body":"The code looks good overall. This basically adds `uid` field to script class cache.\r\n\r\nHowever the usefulness is limited right now; the editor filesystem is able to update the cache even if a file was moved externally. Is there any benefit in caching the script UID?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3367214940/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3367382876","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110779#issuecomment-3367382876","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110779","id":3367382876,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Iti9c","user":{"login":"Rindbee","id":30386067,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzg2MDY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30386067?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee","html_url":"https://github.com/Rindbee","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-03T22:18:30Z","updated_at":"2025-10-03T22:36:17Z","body":"> However the usefulness is limited right now; \r\n\r\nIndeed.\r\n\r\n> the editor filesystem is able to update the cache even if a file was moved externally. Is there any benefit in caching the script UID?\r\n\r\nCurrently, global classes are tracked by class name (no path is needed). This may work when only the file is moved.\r\n\r\nIf multiple scripts with the same class name exist, when the editor is restarted, the paths in the editor will be sorted in alphabetical order, and the scripts at the end will be registered with the ScriptServer.\r\n\r\n`EditorFileSystem` records the class name of each script, although `ScriptServer` does not support alternatives (multiple scripts with the same name).\r\n\r\nIf perform some complex file operations before starting the editor, the uid and path may not be reliable when the editor starts. Using uid and path makes it possible to track changes to files. Especially when there are multiple scripts with the same name. \r\n\r\nFor example, before opening the editor, you copy a previously written script for reuse, but its class name happens to be the same as some scripts in the current project.\r\n\r\nThe uid is added here to use the uid and path to determine the script activated by the current class name.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3367382876/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]